","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"No End and No Beginning","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2015-02-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11#:~:text=as%20long%20as%20your,clean%20from%20the%20desert.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"No End and No Beginning\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11-e6","summary":"The Remembrance urges Daghatar to strike Dromoka, but he chooses instead to sacrifice it.","participants":["the-remembrance","daghatar","dromoka"],"location":"the-meeting-rocks","importance":"major","page":"stories/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11","order":223,"story_date":"2015-02-11","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":54,"quote":"Raise me up. Strike your enemy down, now.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11#:~:text=Raise%20me%20up.%20Strike%20your%20enemy%20down%2C%20now.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"No End and No Beginning","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2015-02-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11#:~:text=Raise%20me%20up.%20Strike%20your%20enemy%20down%2C%20now.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"No End and No Beginning\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11-e7","summary":"Daghatar shatters the Remembrance with the mace, destroying the ancestors it held.","participants":["daghatar","the-remembrance"],"location":"the-meeting-rocks","importance":"major","page":"stories/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11","order":223,